### Requests for Visual Studio, Rider or the VS Code REST Client extension.
@host = https://localhost:7162

### Health (version and commit of the running build)
GET {{host}}/health

### Supported output languages
GET {{host}}/api/conversions/languages

### Convert (the task's largest example, in Belgian French)
POST {{host}}/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "999 999 999,99", "language": "fr-BE" }

### Convert from the query string
GET {{host}}/api/conversions?amount=25,1&language=de-DE

### Every language at once
POST {{host}}/api/conversions/all-languages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "45 100" }

### A refusal: points are not decimal separators
POST {{host}}/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": "25.10", "language": "en-US" }

### Instance information and optional features
GET {{host}}/api/app-info

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
